olid and serves as the Executive Director of the Instituto de Endocrinología y Nutrición. His contributions to the field of clinical nutrition are significant, as he has co-authored studies on water metabolism in patients receiving artificial nutrition and has researched immunonutrition in artificial nutritional support.\n\nIn addition to his work in general nutrition, Daniel Antonio De Luis Román has focused on the nutritional needs of patients undergoing head and neck tumor surgery, demonstrating his expertise in this specialized area. His extensive involvement in various topics related to nutrition underscores his commitment to advancing knowledge and practices in the field, making him a key figure in the study and application of nutritional support in clinical settings.", "EMILIA GÓMEZ HOYOS:Emilia Gómez Hoyos is a medical professional and researcher specializing in nutrition, with a particular focus on enteral and parenteral nutrition. She has made significant contributions to the field of immunonutrition in artificial nutritional support, emphasizing its importance in clinical settings. Her research extends to the study of nutrition in oncology, where she has specifically investigated the nutritional needs of patients with head and neck tumors. Additionally, Emilia is recognized as an author in the field of clinical nutrition, contributing to various studies, including one on water metabolism in patients receiving artificial nutrition. Through her work, Emilia Gómez Hoyos has established herself as a key figure in advancing knowledge and practices related to nutritional support in medical care.", "JUAN JOSÉ LÓPEZ GÓMEZ:Juan José López Gómez is a distinguished medical professional specializing in nutrition, particularly in the areas of enteral and parenteral nutrition. He has made significant contributions to the field through his research and clinical practice. López Gómez is a co-author of a study focused on water metabolism in patients receiving artificial nutrition and has also contributed to research on immunonutrition in artificial nutritional support. His expertise extends to oncology nutrition, where he is involved in the nutritional management of patients undergoing treatment for head and neck tumors. Overall, Juan José López Gómez is recognized for his comprehensive work in clinical nutrition, with a particular emphasis on enteral nutrition and its various indications.", "BEATRIZ TORRES TORRES:Beatriz Torres Torres is a distinguished medical professional and researcher specializing in clinical nutrition, particularly in the context of artificial nutrition. She has co-authored a study on water metabolism in patients receiving artificial nutrition and has contributed significantly to research on immunonutrition in artificial nutritional support. Her expertise extends to both enteral and parenteral nutrition, where she has been actively involved in both study and practice. Additionally, Beatriz Torres Torres focuses on oncology nutrition, with a particular emphasis on the nutritional needs of patients with head and neck tumors. Through her work, she has established herself as a key figure in the field of clinical nutrition and parenteral nutrition.", "NUTRITION IN ONCOLOGY:Nutrition in Oncology is a specialized field of study that concentrates on the nutritional needs and interventions for cancer patients. This area of research is particularly important for individuals undergoing treatments such as hematopoietic stem cell transplants, as it addresses the unique dietary requirements and challenges faced by these patients during their treatment journey.", "ARTIFICIAL ENTERAL NUTRITION:Artificial enteral nutrition refers to the provision of nutrients through a feeding tube, which is critical for patients unable to eat by mouth.", "NEUROPROTECTIVE STRATEGIES:Neuroprotective strategies are approaches aimed at protecting the brain from injury or degeneration, often involving dietary interventions.", "YAIZA LÓPEZ PLASENCIA:Yaiza López Plasencia is a healthcare professional and medical expert specializing in the assessment and nutritional support of oncology patients. She plays a crucial role in providing nutritional guidance and support tailored to the needs of individuals undergoing cancer treatment, ensuring they receive the necessary care to enhance their overall health and well-being during this challenging time.", "DUNIA MARRERO ARENCIBIA:Dunia Marrero Arencibia is a healthcare professional specializing in oncology nutrition, where she plays a vital role in providing nutritional support to oncology patients. Her expertise in this field enables her to contribute significantly to the well-being and recovery of individuals undergoing cancer treatment.", "CARLOS RODRÍGUEZ PÉREZ:Carlos Rodríguez Pérez is a healthcare professional who specializes in the nutritional support and assessment of oncology patients. His work focuses on ensuring that patients undergoing cancer treatment receive appropriate nutritional care to support their health and recovery.", "ELENA GARCÍA FERNÁNDEZ:Dr. Elena García Fernández is a medical professional specializing in nutritional support for hematological patients. She is actively involved in the fields of nutrition and endocrinology at Hospital Universitario 12 de Octubre, where she applies her expertise to enhance the health and well-being of her patients.", "M.ÁNGELES VALERO ZANUY:M. Ángeles Valero Zanuy is a medical professional specializing in nutritional support for patients undergoing bone marrow transplants.", "HOSPITAL CLÍNICO UNIVERSITARIO:The Hospital Clínico Universitario is a prominent medical institution located in Valladolid, Spain. It serves as a clinical hospital that provides a wide range of medical services and is actively involved in research. The hospital specializes in various fields, including oncology nutrition, endocrinology, and clinical nutrition. Additionally, it conducts research and clinical practices related to pediatric gastroenterology and nutrition. Overall, the Hospital Clínico Universitario is recognized for its comprehensive approach to healthcare, integrating both clinical services and research initiatives to enhance patient care and medical knowledge."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}